  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（嘶吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他快不行了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上啊，拿下他，這巫術祭壇就廢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "弩箭插進薩卡茲的胸膛。\n他並未在意，仍想繼續前進。\n“嘀嘀”“嘀嘀”。\n他低下頭，看到插在胸口的箭羽正在發亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "集束彈藥在薩卡茲的血肉中爆裂。\n一次又一次密集的爆炸，再強大的巫術都無法如此迅速地修復創傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……成功了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，真的倒了，炸沒了，只剩下骨頭渣子了！這方法真的有效，我們果然不用怕這些怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲的殘骸在發光。\n士兵們不由得開始後退，但已經來不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "噴薄的火光和源石粉塵吞沒了戰場一角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "宗長！您的身體……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不影響戰鬥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維多利亞人，攻勢猛烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們適應得很快……幾乎找到了對付我們的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的損傷正越來越大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的戰士，不會放棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們的防線，仍能堅持。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“靈幛”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已經足夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我相信特雷西斯，與特蕾西婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孽茨雷",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至今……不變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "BM和TAA兩條路目前是暢通的，可以走！在接下來的十五分鐘裡，源石晶簇還不會長過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I9不行，費斯特，注意信標顏色變動。附近的源石山有崩塌風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——可露希爾，我們在I903偵察點！有人受傷，看起來是平民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看到了看到了，有一輛小車在路上了。注意收貨，把防具和藥拿上，它知道接下來要去哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦對，還有兩架無人機也往你們的方向去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "待會霧升起來之後，你看訊號燈的顏色，綠的就是前路沒問題。典範軍的人會在I901接應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我忍不住想……可露希爾，你這同時在操控多少雙手啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "還好，也就七八……\n唔，十幾雙吧。眼睛會更多一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眼下的處境比絕大多數羅德島的天災救援任務都要複雜。芬……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，不會掉以輕心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可露希爾，你也要……滋滋滋……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……通訊干擾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "176和178號無人機失去訊號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……發現物資點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "藥，吃的，都有。沒什麼能用的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "藥和食物可以給你一份。多的就不要拿了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這赤手空拳的還能攔著……呃，血魔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別怕，和王庭沒關係，我也不會那種一下子抽乾你們血的法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呸，真要是那幫老混帳的人，我一下就射穿你的脖子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你們並不是來執行任務的。曼弗雷德還不會派一隊連我們的標誌都不認識的人過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道說這些話可能對你們沒什麼用……但這個位置馬上就要炸開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能不能，不要影響我工作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這要命的天災怎麼又要來了？王庭那幫老東西搓出來的到底是什麼東西啊，這鬼地方真是沒法待了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，我是467號，你們人呢？我說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "襲擊營地的雇傭兵均已解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可露希爾，走吧。該轉移到下一個安全地點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，謝啦，刺客大師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "投降嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "投降的話，你可以跟著我們一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……都被你們抓了，那我有什麼好選的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這場仗打到現在，散落在戰場各處的雇傭兵會增多。除了聽從軍事委員會的指揮，他們還會幹回老本行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，類似的攻擊我們還會遭遇很多次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年……我們不也是這麼過來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無論是需要穿越天災，還是更多敵人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們都會盡力讓更多想回家的人……回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "軍事委員會是不是又有新訊息了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽說他們剛殺了一個維多利亞大公爵，馬上就會殺第二個第三個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳……你那最近還有，呃，好用的藥嗎？我想治治這條傷腿，哪怕只是讓石頭稍微少一點，打起仗來跑得快一點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也要去倫蒂尼姆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆？我這哪趕得上，就算我想去，攝政王也不會要我啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這場仗……早晚會打到卡茲戴爾的吧？那群維多利亞人，萊塔尼亞人……他們哪裡會這麼輕易就放過我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲平民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說，小個子，你也早做打算吧。再磨一磨你的兵器，回想下該怎麼殺人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……軍事委員會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼多年了，我們的城市，真的又要……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……哈……終於趕上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，你是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔……你的同行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧達",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是說信使啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，一晃這麼多年過去，我對卡茲戴爾都不太熟了。我聽說啊，我能在這個座標找到我要找的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃芒加德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能告訴我——去“巴別塔”舊址的路該怎麼走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一座塔。\n只要塔建得足夠高，就能抵達我們頭頂的黑暗。\n我們建起的一切固然都會崩塌毀滅，掩於流沙。\n但我們的意志，我們的渴求，會億萬次於塵埃中崛起。\n攀登。\n攀登。\n不斷地向上，越過我們的無知。\n直至，超越黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就是為什麼……這裡會有一座塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，我們看起來總算走到頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到底爬了多久？我覺得自己過了好幾輩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，說不定……還要更長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小兔子！你一直在發什麼呆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……死掉的老傢伙們連詞彙量都很匱乏的嘮叨？你還沒聽膩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿米婭知道自己聽見的是誰的聲音。\n魔王就在眾魂之間。\n眾魂想讓魔王傾聽。\n阿米婭不由自主地想隨著這個聲音潛入“魔王”深處，在無數的時間與空間的碎片中摸索。\n戒指頂著她的掌心。\n只要解開它們……她就能讓從古至今的秘密，一切的來龍去脈湧入她的大腦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭，不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眾魂的意志在影響你，他們迫不及待地想讓你接受他們的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想理解……她的情感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你需要直面她。我們都需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是的，阿米婭。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們一起。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "除了眾魂之外……博士、凱爾希醫生、W小姐的心聲都很清晰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一般敢用源石技藝窺探我的想法的人，下場都不太好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是……哈，我打賭我們這幾個走到這裡的人，想法都差不多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "急迫，緊張，又飽含著期待。\n和死寂的過往回聲截然不同的，是屬於此時此刻的鮮活情感。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "一起上去吧，還差最後一點了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "讓我想想看，這層透明的天花板該怎麼拆？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "或許……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她已經告訴了我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "懸在他們頭頂的，黑暗中的眼睛。\n一個菱形。\n既像是黑暗中僅有的光源，又彷彿是吞噬了萬物光華的罪魁禍首——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阿米婭抬起頭。\n眾魂之間的每一個魔王抬起頭。\n阿米婭向菱形伸出手去。\n眾魂之間的每一個魔王都伸出手去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "這是第一位魔王留給我的唯一的言語——\n“如黑夜般籠罩我們的石頭，它是我們的苦難，更是一種希望。”\n我們恰是為了希望而來。\n在這一刻，“遠逐者”“砌城匠”“青色怒火”……所有魔王都與我在一起。就連以勒什都再度拿起了他的法杖。\n他們與我一同戰鬥。\n為了同一個使命。\n魔王的使命。\n薩卡茲的未來，將在此揭曉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "天與地，上與下，光明與黑暗，未來與過去——\n都在瞬間倒轉。\n在塔頂也是塔底，終點也是原點，阿米婭聽到了一聲嘆息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們等到你了……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "……“魔王”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
